-- title:
--   Hiding answers only need the prefix requested at their own level to be attainable; the unvisited components are unrestricted
-- statement:
--   A statement of the module `MIPRE.Foundations.Introspection.AuxiliaryScanCorrect` of the MIP\* = RE formalization (commit `70cbf1c` of vidick/MIPRE-formalization). Correctness of the actual attained-prefix scan. The only query hypotheses are the source interface's legal-prefix clauses. The returned witness proves the next call is legal. Honest outputs pass all stages, while arbitrary malformed or unattainable claims may be rejected.
--
--   Hiding answers only need the prefix requested at their own level to be
--   attainable; the unvisited components are unrestricted.
--
--   **Formal statement.** In Lean, with the scope shown:
--
--   ```lean
--   open MIPRE
